@startuml
title Research Desk demo team: bounded critique cycle with RAG and a human gate
skinparam backgroundColor #FBFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #3D5366
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #EEF6FC
  BorderColor #4E7B99
}

rectangle "Question\n(input)" as input #DCEEFF
rectangle "Draft\nResearcher agent (structured-v1)\nretrieve then draft" as draft #C9E4F7
rectangle "Critique\nCritic agent (structured-v1)\nfixed-token rubric to integer score" as critique #C9E4F7
rectangle "Decide\ngateway, firstMatch" as decide #FFF0C2
rectangle "Escalation gate\napproval: owner, quorum 1, no timeout" as gate #FFE0B8
rectangle "Archive\nArchivist agent (structured-v1)\nfiles human answers" as archive #C9E4F7
rectangle "Answer\n(output)" as answer #C8E8D0
rectangle "Refused\n(final)" as refused #F6BFC0

rectangle "ChromaDB collection\nembers-demo-docs\nrho:chroma:collection:entries:query" as chroma #E8DDF5
rectangle "OpenAI completion\nrho:ai:gpt4" as gpt4 #E8DDF5

input --> draft : completed
draft --> critique : completed
critique --> decide : completed
decide --> answer : #0 accept\n<latex>output.score \geq 80</latex>
decide --> draft : #1 revise (unconditional)\nloop maxIterations = 3
decide --> gate : iterationLimit
gate --> archive : completed (approve;\nnull preserves, non-null replaces)
archive --> answer : completed\n(archived flag)
gate --> refused : rejected

draft ..> chroma : top-10 similarity query
draft ..> gpt4 : grounded draft / revision
critique ..> gpt4 : verdict line\nEXCELLENT, GOOD, WEAK, POOR
archive ..> chroma : idempotent create + upsert\nrho:chroma:collection:entries:new

note bottom of decide #EAF7EE
The revise back-edge crosses a bounded transition, so every
hot cycle has a progress boundary. Deploying without the
bound is rejected with the diagnostic cycle-without-progress;
exhausting it rewrites the token disposition to iterationLimit
at the decide node, which routes to the human gate.
end note

note bottom of chroma #F2ECFA
Both services are replay-cached non-deterministic system
processes on the validator: the first execution records the
observed result on chain and replay returns the recording.
The Archive edge writes the same collection the Draft edge
reads: the knowledge loop.
end note
@enduml
